-[source,console]
------------------------------------
-POST /_security/role/slm-admin
-{
-  "cluster": ["manage_slm", "cluster:admin/snapshot/*"],
-  "indices": [
-    {
-      "names": [".slm-history-*"],
-      "privileges": ["all"]
-    }
-  ]
-}
------------------------------------
